# the mink library, what a dependent's `use mink;` binds
#
# the list is mink's public surface: each module forwarded here is one a
# dependent imports, and a module no dependent imports is internal to mink
# and may change without notice, the link phases and the relocation rows
# among them. a dependent imports a module by its source path, never through
# this list, and the list follows those imports: a module joins it when a
# dependent first imports it and leaves it when none does. nothing in the
# build enforces it, so review holds the line, and a change to a module on
# the list carries a Consumer changes section naming its downstream port.

